{"id":"86ae1972e19732da","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-deterministic-interactive-proof.md","title":"确定型交互证明类dIP","display":"df-deterministic-interactive-proof — 确定型交互证明类dIP","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-deterministic-interactive-proof","aliases":["28-df-deterministic-interactive-proof"],"display":"df-deterministic-interactive-proof — 确定型交互证明类dIP","depends_on":["[[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; Definitions 8.2–8.3","source_printed_pages":"144–145","source_pdf_pages":"170–171","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-deterministic-interactive-proof"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-deterministic-interactive-proof</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-deterministic-interactive-proof — 确定型交互证明类dIP"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"adb92775ec020a0b\" href=\"?note=adb92775ec020a0b\" title=\"28-df-polynomial-time-function\">28-df-polynomial-time-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; Definitions 8.2–8.3"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"144–145"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"170–171"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^{\\le m}=\\bigcup_{j=0}^m\\Sigma^j\">\\(\\Sigma^{\\le m}=\\bigcup_{j=0}^m\\Sigma^j\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,k:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(p,k:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 是一元输入上多项式时间可计算且多项式有界的函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{FP}\">\\(\\mathbf{FP}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"adb92775ec020a0b\" href=\"?note=adb92775ec020a0b\" title=\"28-df-polynomial-time-function\">28-df-polynomial-time-function</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\cdot\\rangle:\\bigcup_{j\\in\\mathbb N}(\\Sigma^*)^j\\hookrightarrow\\Sigma^*\">\\(\\langle\\cdot\\rangle:\\bigcup_{j\\in\\mathbb N}(\\Sigma^*)^j\\hookrightarrow\\Sigma^*\\)</span> 是固定单射扁平序列编码；码像可多项式时间判定，编码及像上的逆可在各自输入长度的多项式时间计算，码长与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j+\\sum_{h=1}^j|u_h|+1\">\\(j+\\sum_{h=1}^j|u_h|+1\\)</span> 彼此多项式有界；0、1、i 各用其无前导零二进制编码。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma^*\">\\(P:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma^*\\)</span> 没有计算时间限制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{DRun}_{V,P,p,k}(x,\\vec a,\\vec b)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\\vec a,\\vec b\\in(\\Sigma^{\\le p(|x|)})^{k(|x|)}\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k(|x|)\\}\\;\\left[a_i=V(\\langle0,x,i,a_1,b_1,\\ldots,a_{i-1},b_{i-1}\\rangle)\\land b_i=P(\\langle x,a_1,b_1,\\ldots,a_{i-1},b_{i-1},a_i\\rangle)\\right].\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{DRun}_{V,P,p,k}(x,\\vec a,\\vec b)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\\vec a,\\vec b\\in(\\Sigma^{\\le p(|x|)})^{k(|x|)}\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k(|x|)\\}\\;\\left[a_i=V(\\langle0,x,i,a_1,b_1,\\ldots,a_{i-1},b_{i-1}\\rangle)\\land b_i=P(\\langle x,a_1,b_1,\\ldots,a_{i-1},b_{i-1},a_i\\rangle)\\right].\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{DAcc}_{V,P,p,k}(x)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists\\vec a,\\vec b\\;\\left[\\operatorname{DRun}_{V,P,p,k}(x,\\vec a,\\vec b)\\land V(\\langle1,x,a_1,b_1,\\ldots,a_{k(|x|)},b_{k(|x|)}\\rangle)=1\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{DAcc}_{V,P,p,k}(x)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists\\vec a,\\vec b\\;\\left[\\operatorname{DRun}_{V,P,p,k}(x,\\vec a,\\vec b)\\land V(\\langle1,x,a_1,b_1,\\ldots,a_{k(|x|)},b_{k(|x|)}\\rangle)=1\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{dIP}\\coloneqq\\left\\{L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*: \\exists V\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\;\\exists p,k\\;\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\left(x\\in L\\leftrightarrow\\exists P:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma^*\\;\\operatorname{DAcc}_{V,P,p,k}(x)\\right)\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf{dIP}\\coloneqq\\left\\{L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*: \\exists V\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\;\\exists p,k\\;\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\left(x\\in L\\leftrightarrow\\exists P:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma^*\\;\\operatorname{DAcc}_{V,P,p,k}(x)\\right)\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>外层p,k量化限于Hypothesis所述可计算多项式界。一个i包含询问和回答两条消息，所以与书中的消息轮数差因子2。超长消息没有合法DRun而拒绝；合法历史按i唯一递归确定。存在P的等价式同时表达真输入的完备性和假输入对所有P的可靠性，不要求P可计算。扁平编码避免反复嵌套配对导致长度指数增长。</p>\n<p>来源：用户所给 Arora–Barak PDF，Definitions 8.2–8.3；印刷 pp.144–145 / PDF pp.170–171。本次核对范围：定义陈述与本地形式化。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-polynomial-time-function","status":"resolved","id":"adb92775ec020a0b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-polynomial-time-function","status":"resolved","id":"adb92775ec020a0b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$\\Sigma^{\\le m}=\\bigcup_{j=0}^m\\Sigma^j$。$p,k:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N$ 是一元输入上多项式时间可计算且多项式有界的函数；$\\mathbf{FP}$ 见 [[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]。$\\langle\\cdot\\rangle:\\bigcup_{j\\in\\mathbb N}(\\Sigma^*)^j\\hookrightarrow\\Sigma^*$ 是固定单射扁平序列编码；码像可多项式时间判定，编码及像上的逆可在各自输入长度的多项式时间计算，码长与 $j+\\sum_{h=1}^j|u_h|+1$ 彼此多项式有界；0、1、i 各用其无前导零二进制编码。$P:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma^*$ 没有计算时间限制。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma^{\\le m}=\\bigcup_{j=0}^m\\Sigma^j","display":false},{"tex":"p,k:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{FP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle\\cdot\\rangle:\\bigcup_{j\\in\\mathbb N}(\\Sigma^*)^j\\hookrightarrow\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"j+\\sum_{h=1}^j|u_h|+1","display":false},{"tex":"P:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{DRun}_{V,P,p,k}(x,\\vec a,\\vec b)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\\vec a,\\vec b\\in(\\Sigma^{\\le p(|x|)})^{k(|x|)}\\\\&\\land\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k(|x|)\\}\\;\\left[a_i=V(\\langle0,x,i,a_1,b_1,\\ldots,a_{i-1},b_{i-1}\\rangle)\\land b_i=P(\\langle x,a_1,b_1,\\ldots,a_{i-1},b_{i-1},a_i\\rangle)\\right].\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{DAcc}_{V,P,p,k}(x)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists\\vec a,\\vec b\\;\\left[\\operatorname{DRun}_{V,P,p,k}(x,\\vec a,\\vec b)\\land V(\\langle1,x,a_1,b_1,\\ldots,a_{k(|x|)},b_{k(|x|)}\\rangle)=1\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbf{dIP}\\coloneqq\\left\\{L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*: \\exists V\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\;\\exists p,k\\;\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\left(x\\in L\\leftrightarrow\\exists P:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma^*\\;\\operatorname{DAcc}_{V,P,p,k}(x)\\right)\\right\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":2677,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-307","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-deterministic-interactive-proof]]、[[28-thm-dip-equals-np]]、[[28-df-formula-arithmetization]]、[[28-df-sumcheck-protocol]]、[[28-thm-sumcheck-soundness]]、[[28-df-program-checker]]。"},{"id":"f3b260a182e7f67d","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbf{dIP}$ 见 [[28-df-deterministic-interactive-proof]]；$\\mathbf{NP}$ 见 [[28-df-np]]。"}],"outgoing":["adb92775ec020a0b"]}